1
00:00:02,509 --> 00:00:03,885
KATARA: Water.

2
00:00:04,886 --> 00:00:06,054
Earth.

3
00:00:06,846 --> 00:00:08,139
Fire.

4
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:10,183
Air.

5
00:00:11,017 --> 00:00:14,979
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:18,733
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,692 --> 00:00:22,529
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

8
00:00:22,612 --> 00:00:23,821
could stop them.

9
00:00:23,905 --> 00:00:26,658
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

10
00:00:27,158 --> 00:00:29,744
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I discovered

11
00:00:29,827 --> 00:00:32,664
the new Avatar,
an Airbender named Aang.

12
00:00:32,914 --> 00:00:35,041
And although
his airbending skills are great,

13
00:00:35,124 --> 00:00:37,710
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

14
00:00:37,794 --> 00:00:38,920
AANG: Oof!

15
00:00:39,003 --> 00:00:41,965
KATARA: But I believe
Aang can save the world.

16
00:00:53,297 --> 00:00:54,464
( LAPPING WATER )

17
00:00:54,548 --> 00:00:57,092
-( APPA GRUNTING )
-( SQUAWKING )

18
00:00:57,467 --> 00:00:59,553
So, what kind of trouble is Katara in?

19
00:01:00,012 --> 00:01:01,013
I don't know.

20
00:01:01,096 --> 00:01:03,056
In my vision, I just
knew she needed help.

21
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:04,933
It would be nice
if your Avatar powers

22
00:01:05,017 --> 00:01:07,602
could be just a little more
specific from time to time.

23
00:01:07,686 --> 00:01:09,938
-( LOUD RUMBLING )
- What is that?

24
00:01:15,235 --> 00:01:16,570
Need a ride?

25
00:01:16,653 --> 00:01:17,654
( GASPING )

26
00:01:17,738 --> 00:01:18,822
BOTH: Ohhhh...

27
00:01:19,489 --> 00:01:22,117
The Earth King
and The Council of Five

28
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,410
do not trust the Dai Li.

29
00:01:23,910 --> 00:01:26,330
They imprisoned your leader, Long Feng.

30
00:01:26,455 --> 00:01:29,499
Soon they will turn on all
of you and eliminate you.

31
00:01:29,624 --> 00:01:33,086
Seizing power today
is a matter of life and death.

32
00:01:33,754 --> 00:01:36,423
This coup must be
swift and decisive.

33
00:01:36,506 --> 00:01:38,675
The Earth King, and each
of the five generals,

34
00:01:38,759 --> 00:01:40,719
must be taken out,
simultaneously.

35
00:01:40,802 --> 00:01:42,971
Long Feng has placed
you in my command

36
00:01:43,055 --> 00:01:44,890
while we overthrow
the government.

37
00:01:45,432 --> 00:01:49,019
If I sense any disloyalty,
any hesitation,

38
00:01:49,102 --> 00:01:50,979
any weakness at all,

39
00:01:51,063 --> 00:01:52,522
I will snuff it out.

40
00:01:55,776 --> 00:01:57,444
That is all.

41
00:01:59,821 --> 00:02:01,156
Nice speech, Azula.

42
00:02:01,239 --> 00:02:04,076
It was pretty and poetic,
but also scary in a good way.

43
00:02:04,284 --> 00:02:07,454
Yeah, I thought you were gonna
make that one guy pee his pants.

44
00:02:07,996 --> 00:02:09,831
There are still a few loose ends―

45
00:02:09,956 --> 00:02:12,459
The Avatar, and my brother and uncle.

46
00:02:13,043 --> 00:02:15,629
Many times, I imagined myself here―

47
00:02:15,712 --> 00:02:18,006
At the threshold of the palace.

48
00:02:18,590 --> 00:02:21,593
But I always thought I would
be here as a conqueror.

49
00:02:21,676 --> 00:02:25,430
Instead, we are the Earth King's
personal guests,

50
00:02:25,514 --> 00:02:27,557
here to serve him tea.

51
00:02:28,058 --> 00:02:30,477
Destiny is a funny thing.

52
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,978
It sure is, Uncle.

53
00:02:33,063 --> 00:02:34,940
TOPH: So, how did it go with the Guru?

54
00:02:35,065 --> 00:02:36,691
Did you master the Avatar State?

55
00:02:36,775 --> 00:02:37,901
Uh...

56
00:02:38,193 --> 00:02:39,736
If you leave now,

57
00:02:39,820 --> 00:02:42,322
you won't be able to go into
the Avatar State at all!

58
00:02:42,572 --> 00:02:43,907
SOKKA: Aang, are you okay?

59
00:02:43,990 --> 00:02:45,117
I'm great.

60
00:02:45,242 --> 00:02:46,618
It went great with the Guru.

61
00:02:46,743 --> 00:02:48,703
I completely mastered the Avatar State.

62
00:02:48,829 --> 00:02:50,288
( NERVOUS LAUGHTER )

63
00:02:50,414 --> 00:02:51,748
Yeah.

64
00:02:59,005 --> 00:03:00,298
What's taking so long?

65
00:03:01,216 --> 00:03:03,760
Maybe the Earth King overslept.

66
00:03:07,556 --> 00:03:09,391
Something's not right.

67
00:03:11,601 --> 00:03:13,186
AZULA: It's tea time.

68
00:03:13,687 --> 00:03:14,688
Azula!

69
00:03:14,771 --> 00:03:16,148
Have you met the Dai Li?

70
00:03:16,481 --> 00:03:17,816
They're Earthbenders,

71
00:03:17,899 --> 00:03:21,361
but they have a killer instinct
that's so Firebender.

72
00:03:21,445 --> 00:03:22,571
I just love it.

73
00:03:23,864 --> 00:03:26,450
Did I ever tell you
how I got the nickname

74
00:03:26,533 --> 00:03:28,118
the "Dragon of the West"?

75
00:03:28,577 --> 00:03:31,580
I'm not interested in
a lengthy anecdote, Uncle.

76
00:03:31,663 --> 00:03:33,999
It's more of a demonstration, really.

77
00:03:34,332 --> 00:03:36,209
( SIPPING TEA )

78
00:03:49,306 --> 00:03:50,765
( EXPLOSION )

79
00:03:51,475 --> 00:03:52,767
( SCREAMING )

80
00:03:53,268 --> 00:03:54,352
( GRUNTS )

81
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:57,731
Come on!

82
00:03:57,856 --> 00:03:59,149
You'll be fine!

83
00:03:59,608 --> 00:04:01,860
No. I'm tired of running.

84
00:04:01,985 --> 00:04:03,528
It's time I faced Azula.

85
00:04:07,949 --> 00:04:09,743
AZULA: You're so dramatic.

86
00:04:09,826 --> 00:04:12,704
What? Are you going to
challenge me to an Agni Kai?

87
00:04:13,246 --> 00:04:15,290
Yes! I challenge you!

88
00:04:15,373 --> 00:04:16,416
No, thanks.

89
00:04:18,251 --> 00:04:19,294
( ROAR OF EFFORT )

90
00:04:23,632 --> 00:04:24,758
Oh!

91
00:04:24,883 --> 00:04:26,176
( STRAINING )

92
00:04:29,930 --> 00:04:31,389
( APPA GROWLING )

93
00:04:32,224 --> 00:04:33,683
Katara's fine.

94
00:04:33,767 --> 00:04:35,268
You have nothing
to worry about.

95
00:04:35,644 --> 00:04:37,145
But, in my vision...

96
00:04:37,229 --> 00:04:39,356
I felt so sure that
she was in trouble.

97
00:04:39,481 --> 00:04:42,692
Well, she met with the Council of Generals
to plan the invasion.

98
00:04:42,776 --> 00:04:45,070
And since then she's been
off with your friends,

99
00:04:45,153 --> 00:04:46,488
the Kyoshi Warriors.

100
00:04:46,571 --> 00:04:47,864
See Aang? She's with Suki.

101
00:04:47,948 --> 00:04:50,242
They're probably back at
our apartment right now,

102
00:04:50,325 --> 00:04:52,035
talking about
makeup or something.

103
00:04:52,118 --> 00:04:53,828
Okay, maybe you're right.

104
00:04:53,912 --> 00:04:56,498
Believe me, if there
was any danger at all,

105
00:04:56,581 --> 00:04:59,167
Bosco's animal
instincts would sense it.

106
00:04:59,668 --> 00:05:01,503
( SLEEPY GROWLING )

107
00:05:05,715 --> 00:05:08,510
( LOUD RUMBLING )

108
00:05:08,593 --> 00:05:10,220
You've got company.

109
00:05:10,637 --> 00:05:12,347
( GASPING, GRUNTING )

110
00:05:13,265 --> 00:05:14,474
Zuko!

111
00:05:17,143 --> 00:05:18,895
( LOUD RUMBLING )

112
00:05:27,070 --> 00:05:28,863
- Momo!
-( CHATTERING )

113
00:05:32,492 --> 00:05:34,077
There's no one else here.

114
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:36,162
Katara is in trouble. I knew it.

115
00:05:36,246 --> 00:05:37,497
Oh, no.

116
00:05:37,622 --> 00:05:40,375
Wait, someone's at the door.

117
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:41,793
( KNOCKING AT DOOR )

118
00:05:41,918 --> 00:05:43,920
Actually, I know who it is.

119
00:05:44,045 --> 00:05:45,714
It's an old friend of mine.

120
00:05:45,797 --> 00:05:47,007
Glad to see you're okay.

121
00:05:47,674 --> 00:05:48,800
I need your help.

122
00:05:48,883 --> 00:05:50,343
( AANG AND SOKKA GASP )

123
00:05:54,764 --> 00:05:56,391
( CHATTERING )

124
00:05:57,058 --> 00:05:58,768
You guys know each other?

125
00:05:58,852 --> 00:06:01,146
I met him in the woods
once and knocked him down.

126
00:06:01,229 --> 00:06:03,607
Then he gave me tea
and some very good advice.

127
00:06:03,690 --> 00:06:05,317
May I come in?

128
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:11,323
Princess Azula is here in Ba Sing Se.

129
00:06:11,781 --> 00:06:13,033
She must have Katara.

130
00:06:13,158 --> 00:06:15,660
She has captured my nephew, as well.

131
00:06:15,744 --> 00:06:17,704
Then we'll work together
to fight Azula,

132
00:06:17,787 --> 00:06:19,080
and save Katara and Zuko.

133
00:06:19,372 --> 00:06:22,167
Whoa, there. You lost me at, "Zuko".

134
00:06:22,292 --> 00:06:25,128
I know how you must
feel about my nephew.

135
00:06:25,211 --> 00:06:28,840
But believe me when I tell
you there is good inside him.

136
00:06:29,341 --> 00:06:31,092
Good inside him isn't enough.

137
00:06:31,176 --> 00:06:33,970
Why don't you come back when
it's outside him, too, okay?

138
00:06:34,054 --> 00:06:35,388
Katara's in trouble.

139
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:37,724
All of Ba Sing Se is in trouble.

140
00:06:38,099 --> 00:06:40,226
Working together
is our best chance.

141
00:06:40,310 --> 00:06:41,770
Mmm...

142
00:06:42,020 --> 00:06:45,398
I brought someone along
who might be able to help us.

143
00:06:49,778 --> 00:06:52,405
( MUFFLED GASPING )

144
00:06:54,866 --> 00:06:56,743
Azula and Long Feng
are plotting a coup.

145
00:06:56,826 --> 00:06:58,870
They're going to overthrow the Earth King.

146
00:06:59,079 --> 00:07:00,163
My sister!

147
00:07:00,246 --> 00:07:01,748
Where are they keeping Katara?

148
00:07:01,998 --> 00:07:04,209
In the crystal catacombs
of old Ba Sing Se,

149
00:07:04,334 --> 00:07:05,502
deep beneath the palace.

150
00:07:07,629 --> 00:07:10,298
The movements of all
the generals and the Earth King

151
00:07:10,382 --> 00:07:12,384
have been plotted
out step-by-step.

152
00:07:12,467 --> 00:07:13,802
Good.

153
00:07:13,885 --> 00:07:16,429
And the Fire Nation Princess
is cooperating?

154
00:07:16,513 --> 00:07:18,640
Oh, yes, more than cooperating―

155
00:07:18,723 --> 00:07:20,558
She's really taken charge.

156
00:07:20,642 --> 00:07:24,521
She's terrifying
and inspirational at the same time.

157
00:07:24,604 --> 00:07:26,356
It's hard to explain.

158
00:07:31,444 --> 00:07:33,446
Why did they throw you in here?

159
00:07:34,114 --> 00:07:37,701
Oh, wait. Let me guess― It's a trap,
so that when Aang shows up to help me,

160
00:07:37,784 --> 00:07:40,870
you can finally have him
in your little Fire Nation clutches.

161
00:07:43,915 --> 00:07:46,167
You're a terrible
person, you know that?

162
00:07:46,251 --> 00:07:48,378
Always following us,
hunting the Avatar,

163
00:07:48,503 --> 00:07:50,880
trying to capture the world's
last hope for peace!

164
00:07:51,673 --> 00:07:52,924
But what do you care?

165
00:07:53,007 --> 00:07:54,384
You're the Fire Lord's son.

166
00:07:54,968 --> 00:07:57,971
Spreading war and violence
and hatred is in your blood.

167
00:07:58,096 --> 00:08:00,765
- You don't know what you're talking about.
- I don't?

168
00:08:00,849 --> 00:08:02,308
How dare you!

169
00:08:02,392 --> 00:08:05,520
You have no idea what this
war has put me through.

170
00:08:05,603 --> 00:08:07,313
Me, personally.

171
00:08:07,397 --> 00:08:09,816
The Fire Nation took
my mother away from me.

172
00:08:12,318 --> 00:08:13,695
I'm sorry.

173
00:08:13,778 --> 00:08:15,572
( SOBBING )

174
00:08:15,655 --> 00:08:18,032
That's something we have in common.

175
00:08:21,578 --> 00:08:22,871
Well, what do ya know?

176
00:08:22,996 --> 00:08:25,582
There is an ancient city
down there, but it's deep.

177
00:08:26,166 --> 00:08:28,918
( LOUD RUMBLING )

178
00:08:29,669 --> 00:08:30,795
We should split up.

179
00:08:30,879 --> 00:08:33,047
Aang, you go with Iroh
to look for Katara

180
00:08:33,131 --> 00:08:34,591
and the angry jerk,
no offense.

181
00:08:34,674 --> 00:08:35,884
None taken.

182
00:08:35,967 --> 00:08:38,970
And I'll go with Toph
to warn the Earth King about Azula's coup.

183
00:08:48,229 --> 00:08:50,940
So, Toph thinks you
give pretty good advice―

184
00:08:51,024 --> 00:08:52,275
And great tea.

185
00:08:52,358 --> 00:08:54,694
The key to both is proper aging.

186
00:08:55,028 --> 00:08:56,446
What's on your mind?

187
00:08:59,699 --> 00:09:02,327
Well, I met with this Guru who was
supposed to help me

188
00:09:02,410 --> 00:09:06,456
master the Avatar State,
and control this great power.

189
00:09:06,581 --> 00:09:09,709
But to do it, I had to
let go of someone I love,

190
00:09:10,376 --> 00:09:11,586
and I just couldn't.

191
00:09:11,669 --> 00:09:14,631
Perfection and power are overrated.

192
00:09:15,089 --> 00:09:18,593
I think you were very wise
to choose happiness and love.

193
00:09:21,054 --> 00:09:23,598
What happens if we can't
save everyone and beat Azula?

194
00:09:23,681 --> 00:09:27,352
Without the Avatar State,
what if I'm not powerful enough?

195
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:29,687
I don't know the answer.

196
00:09:29,813 --> 00:09:33,399
Sometimes life is like
this dark tunnel.

197
00:09:33,525 --> 00:09:37,695
You can't always see the light
at the end of the tunnel,

198
00:09:37,821 --> 00:09:40,031
but if you just
keep moving...

199
00:09:43,493 --> 00:09:46,037
...you will come to a better place.

200
00:09:53,878 --> 00:09:55,004
There's General How.

201
00:10:05,807 --> 00:10:07,475
( STRAINING )

202
00:10:08,142 --> 00:10:09,435
What's going on here?

203
00:10:09,519 --> 00:10:11,104
You're under house arrest.

204
00:10:11,646 --> 00:10:13,273
The coup is happening right now.

205
00:10:13,356 --> 00:10:15,191
We've gotta warn the Earth King.

206
00:10:26,661 --> 00:10:27,662
( SCREAMING )

207
00:10:34,002 --> 00:10:35,003
( BOTH SCREAMING )

208
00:10:35,837 --> 00:10:37,463
Thank goodness we're in time!

209
00:10:37,547 --> 00:10:38,965
In time for what?

210
00:10:39,048 --> 00:10:41,426
Yeah, what are you in time for...

211
00:10:42,886 --> 00:10:44,596
...cutie?

212
00:10:44,679 --> 00:10:47,390
Uh, I'm kinda involved with Suki.

213
00:10:47,891 --> 00:10:49,350
Who? ( GASPS )

214
00:10:51,227 --> 00:10:53,187
They're not the real Kyoshi Warriors!

215
00:10:53,646 --> 00:10:54,731
( GASPS )

216
00:10:54,814 --> 00:10:56,357
Sorry to disappoint you.

217
00:11:02,906 --> 00:11:04,282
-( LAUGHING )
-( GASPS )

218
00:11:04,699 --> 00:11:06,993
( GASPING )

219
00:11:07,118 --> 00:11:09,579
Ooh, it's like
we're dancing together.

220
00:11:10,413 --> 00:11:12,457
This fight is over.

221
00:11:22,717 --> 00:11:24,302
Get them all out of my sight.

222
00:11:37,565 --> 00:11:40,318
Now comes the part
where I double-cross you.

223
00:11:40,443 --> 00:11:43,154
Dai Li, arrest the Fire Nation Princess.

224
00:11:45,823 --> 00:11:47,909
I said, arrest her.

225
00:11:49,035 --> 00:11:50,370
What is wrong with you?

226
00:11:50,453 --> 00:11:52,747
It's because they
haven't made up their minds.

227
00:11:52,830 --> 00:11:55,166
They're waiting to see
how this is going to end.

228
00:11:55,249 --> 00:11:56,709
What are you talking about?

229
00:11:56,793 --> 00:11:59,462
I can see your whole
history in your eyes.

230
00:11:59,545 --> 00:12:02,590
You were born with nothing,
so you've had to struggle

231
00:12:02,674 --> 00:12:05,093
and connive and claw your way to power.

232
00:12:05,635 --> 00:12:09,013
But true power,
the divine right to rule,

233
00:12:09,097 --> 00:12:10,765
is something
you're born with.

234
00:12:11,224 --> 00:12:13,309
The fact is, they don't
know which one of us

235
00:12:13,393 --> 00:12:15,687
is going to be sitting
on that throne

236
00:12:15,770 --> 00:12:18,106
and which one is going
to be bowing down.

237
00:12:18,481 --> 00:12:20,650
But I know and you know.

238
00:12:22,652 --> 00:12:23,736
Well?

239
00:12:30,535 --> 00:12:33,037
You've beaten me at my own game.

240
00:12:33,413 --> 00:12:35,081
Don't flatter yourself.

241
00:12:35,164 --> 00:12:36,916
You were never even a player.

242
00:12:39,335 --> 00:12:41,129
I'm sorry I yelled at you before.

243
00:12:41,212 --> 00:12:42,547
It doesn't matter.

244
00:12:42,630 --> 00:12:44,632
It's just that for so long now,

245
00:12:44,716 --> 00:12:46,968
whenever I would imagine
the face of the enemy,

246
00:12:47,051 --> 00:12:48,302
it was your face.

247
00:12:48,594 --> 00:12:49,929
My face.

248
00:12:50,013 --> 00:12:51,139
I see.

249
00:12:51,222 --> 00:12:53,307
No, no, that's not what I meant.

250
00:12:53,391 --> 00:12:54,642
It's okay.

251
00:12:54,726 --> 00:12:56,728
I used to think this
scar marked me.

252
00:12:56,811 --> 00:12:58,646
The mark of the banished prince,

253
00:12:58,730 --> 00:13:00,773
cursed to chase the Avatar forever.

254
00:13:01,107 --> 00:13:04,318
But lately, I've realized
I'm free to determine

255
00:13:04,402 --> 00:13:08,114
my own destiny, even if
I'll never be free of my mark.

256
00:13:08,614 --> 00:13:10,575
Maybe you could be free of it.

257
00:13:10,658 --> 00:13:13,077
- What?
- I have healing abilities.

258
00:13:13,161 --> 00:13:15,621
It's a scar. It can't be healed.

259
00:13:17,457 --> 00:13:20,334
This is water from the Spirit
Oasis at the North Pole.

260
00:13:20,835 --> 00:13:22,086
It has special properties,

261
00:13:22,170 --> 00:13:25,256
so I've been saving it
for something important.

262
00:13:25,339 --> 00:13:27,258
I don't know if it would work, but...

263
00:13:34,724 --> 00:13:36,934
( ROCKS SHATTERING )

264
00:13:37,935 --> 00:13:39,729
Aang!

265
00:13:53,451 --> 00:13:55,536
Aang, I knew you would come.

266
00:13:55,620 --> 00:13:57,538
Uncle, I don't understand.

267
00:13:57,622 --> 00:13:59,290
What are you doing with the Avatar?

268
00:13:59,373 --> 00:14:00,833
Saving you. That's what.

269
00:14:00,917 --> 00:14:03,586
-( GROANS )
- Zuko, it's time we talked.

270
00:14:04,128 --> 00:14:07,381
Go help your other friends.
We'll catch up with you.

271
00:14:15,723 --> 00:14:17,016
Why, Uncle?

272
00:14:17,100 --> 00:14:19,393
You are not the man you used to be, Zuko.

273
00:14:19,685 --> 00:14:22,146
You are stronger and wiser

274
00:14:22,230 --> 00:14:24,816
and freer than
you have ever been.

275
00:14:24,899 --> 00:14:28,111
And now you have come to
the crossroads of your destiny.

276
00:14:28,736 --> 00:14:30,863
It's time for you to choose.

277
00:14:30,947 --> 00:14:33,366
It's time for you to choose good.

278
00:14:33,449 --> 00:14:35,326
-( LOUD RUMBLING )
-( GASPS )

279
00:14:38,287 --> 00:14:40,706
I expected this kind
of treachery from Uncle,

280
00:14:40,957 --> 00:14:45,253
but Zuko, Prince Zuko,
you're a lot of things,

281
00:14:45,336 --> 00:14:47,463
but you're not a traitor, are you?

282
00:14:47,547 --> 00:14:49,215
Release him, immediately!

283
00:14:49,465 --> 00:14:51,551
It's not too late for you, Zuko.

284
00:14:51,634 --> 00:14:53,511
You can still redeem yourself.

285
00:14:53,594 --> 00:14:56,973
The kind of redemption
she offers is not for you.

286
00:14:57,181 --> 00:15:00,143
Why don't you let him decide, Uncle?

287
00:15:00,226 --> 00:15:01,686
I need you, Zuko.

288
00:15:01,853 --> 00:15:04,021
I've plotted every move of this day,

289
00:15:04,147 --> 00:15:06,941
this glorious day in Fire Nation history,

290
00:15:07,066 --> 00:15:09,610
and the only way we win is together.

291
00:15:09,694 --> 00:15:13,030
At the end of this day,
you will have your honor back.

292
00:15:13,114 --> 00:15:15,116
You will have Father's love.

293
00:15:15,199 --> 00:15:17,910
You will have everything you want.

294
00:15:17,994 --> 00:15:20,746
Zuko, I am begging you,

295
00:15:21,038 --> 00:15:25,376
look into your heart and see
what it is that you truly want.

296
00:15:26,043 --> 00:15:27,628
You are free to choose.

297
00:15:40,808 --> 00:15:42,393
We've gotta find Sokka and Toph.

298
00:16:29,398 --> 00:16:30,483
( GASPS )

299
00:16:30,566 --> 00:16:31,567
( GRUNTS )

300
00:16:35,863 --> 00:16:37,406
( GRUNTS )

301
00:16:38,199 --> 00:16:40,576
See any Dai Li agents nearby?

302
00:16:40,701 --> 00:16:42,245
Nope. All clear.

303
00:16:46,707 --> 00:16:48,084
( METAL THUDDING )

304
00:16:48,167 --> 00:16:49,168
Let's go!

305
00:16:49,252 --> 00:16:50,711
I'm not leaving without Bosco!

306
00:16:54,465 --> 00:16:55,466
( GASPS )

307
00:16:55,549 --> 00:16:56,634
( GRUNTS )

308
00:16:56,717 --> 00:16:58,177
( GROANS )

309
00:17:04,308 --> 00:17:05,810
( GRUNTS )

310
00:17:12,441 --> 00:17:13,693
( GRUNTING )

311
00:17:15,820 --> 00:17:16,821
( GASPS )

312
00:17:38,175 --> 00:17:39,385
( GRUNTS )

313
00:17:41,887 --> 00:17:44,098
( GRUNTING )

314
00:18:06,078 --> 00:18:07,455
( GROANING )

315
00:18:13,586 --> 00:18:14,920
I thought you had changed!

316
00:18:15,046 --> 00:18:16,422
( GRUNTS )

317
00:18:18,007 --> 00:18:19,633
I have changed.

318
00:18:19,717 --> 00:18:20,801
( GRUNTS )

319
00:18:46,786 --> 00:18:47,995
Come on, it's easy.

320
00:18:48,079 --> 00:18:51,040
You just walk on your front paws
instead of your rear ones,

321
00:18:51,123 --> 00:18:52,291
like this...

322
00:18:53,084 --> 00:18:54,627
( GASPING )

323
00:18:54,710 --> 00:18:56,045
( GROWLING HAPPILY )

324
00:18:56,712 --> 00:18:58,130
That is a nice trick.

325
00:19:00,216 --> 00:19:01,384
Just take the bear.

326
00:19:02,051 --> 00:19:04,887
- Bosco!
-( GROWLING )

327
00:19:11,310 --> 00:19:12,853
( GASPS )

328
00:19:12,937 --> 00:19:14,522
( GROANS )

329
00:19:15,731 --> 00:19:18,734
( LOUD RUMBLING )

330
00:19:20,528 --> 00:19:22,405
( ROARS )

331
00:19:33,541 --> 00:19:34,708
( SCREAMING )

332
00:19:34,792 --> 00:19:35,876
( GRUNTS )

333
00:19:42,341 --> 00:19:43,592
( GROANS )

334
00:19:58,691 --> 00:20:01,193
AANG: There's too many.

335
00:20:01,318 --> 00:20:04,405
GURU: The only way is to let her go.

336
00:20:05,197 --> 00:20:06,824
I'm sorry, Katara.

337
00:20:44,487 --> 00:20:45,738
( THUNDER CRASHING )

338
00:20:45,821 --> 00:20:47,156
( ELECTRICITY CRACKLING )

339
00:21:08,052 --> 00:21:09,720
( ALL SCREAMING )

340
00:21:21,273 --> 00:21:23,025
You've got to get out of here!

341
00:21:23,108 --> 00:21:25,277
I'll hold them off as long as I can!

342
00:21:25,986 --> 00:21:28,072
( GRUNTS )

343
00:21:49,510 --> 00:21:51,512
( APPA GROWLING )

344
00:22:08,320 --> 00:22:09,530
Oh...

345
00:22:12,491 --> 00:22:13,701
( SIGHS )

346
00:22:13,784 --> 00:22:15,536
( GASPS )

347
00:22:24,753 --> 00:22:26,046
AZULA: We've done it, Zuko.

348
00:22:26,130 --> 00:22:27,840
It's taken a hundred years,

349
00:22:27,923 --> 00:22:30,718
but the Fire Nation
has conquered Ba Sing Se.

350
00:22:30,801 --> 00:22:32,428
I betrayed Uncle.

351
00:22:32,511 --> 00:22:35,097
No, he betrayed you.

352
00:22:36,140 --> 00:22:38,267
Zuko, when you return home,

353
00:22:38,350 --> 00:22:40,978
Father will welcome you as a war hero.

354
00:22:41,061 --> 00:22:42,563
But I don't have the Avatar.

355
00:22:43,022 --> 00:22:45,274
What if Father doesn't
restore my honor?

356
00:22:45,983 --> 00:22:48,068
He doesn't need to, Zuko.

357
00:22:48,193 --> 00:22:51,405
Today, you restored your own honor.

358
00:22:59,997 --> 00:23:02,291
The Earth Kingdom...

359
00:23:02,416 --> 00:23:04,168
Has fallen.
